data: {"p":"response/fragments/-1/results","v":[{"url":"https://news.laodong.vn/cong-nghe/cong-nghe-24h-openai-ngat-internet-khi-luyen-ai-thi-truong-pc-lao-doc-1788333.ldo","title":"Technology 24h: OpenAI cuts off the Internet while training AI, PC market plummets","snippet":"Technology 24h: OpenAI cuts off the Internet while training AI, PC market plummets ... OpenAI restricts advanced AI models from accessing the Internet during training to minimize security risks. Elon Musk invests $1 billion in Skydance ... Global retail sales of personal computers plummet","cite_index":1,"published_at":1792771200.0,"site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/laodong.vn","site_name":"Laodong.vn","query_indexes":[0,1],"provider":null},{"url":"https://www.swissinfo.ch/chi/%e8%8b%b1%e5%9b%bd%e5%8a%a0%e7%a0%81ai%e5%ae%89%e5%85%a8%e6%8a%95%e8%b5%84%e3%80%80%e9%98%b2%e8%8c%83%e7%bd%91%e6%94%bb%e4%b8%8e%e7%94%9f%e7%89%a9%e5%a8%81%e8%83%81/92266556","title":"英国加码AI安全投资 防范网攻与生物威胁","snippet":"此内容发布于 2026年10月24日 - 08:05 3 分钟 （法新社伦敦24日电） 英国政府今天宣布增加人工智慧（AI）安全领域的经费，以因应这项日益先进技术所带来的网路安全风险。","cite_index":2,"published_at":1792771200.0,"site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/swissinfo.ch","site_name":"SWI swissinfo.ch","query_indexes":[1],"provider":null},{"url":"https://www.sohu.com/a/1092071239_115362?scm=10001.325_13-325_13.0.0-0-0-0-0.5_1334&spm=smpc.channel_248.block3_308_NDdFbm_1_fd.1.179281443727144JpAda_324","title":"“AI算力过剩论”搅动，美股半导体板块10月市值蒸发2.2万亿美元；白宫称特朗普夫人促成俄乌局部停火；美联储下周议息90%概率“按兵不动”；黄金跌破4000美元 | 一周国际财经","snippet":"“AI算力过剩论”搅动，美股半导体板块10月市值蒸发2.2万亿美元 ... ◆本周，Meta自由现金流转负加上英伟达“亲儿子”CoreWeave股债双杀，令“AI算力过剩”的恐慌席卷资本市场 ... 潜在估值1500亿美元，美股史上最大半导体IPO终止...","cite_index":3,"published_at":1792771200.0,"site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/sohu.com","site_name":"Sohu","query_indexes":[0],"provider":null},{"url":"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20261024020700011?section=international/north-america","title":"[연합뉴스 이 시각 헤드라인] - 10:30 | 연합뉴스","snippet":"전 세계 웹사이트에서 널리 쓰이는 프로그래밍 언어 'PHP